WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Dispatch board: each day by technician; drag a job onto a technician to assign it. Home-visit bookings show up here automatically.

2
00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:15.100
Pick the day and drag "Unassigned" jobs onto the right technician.

3
00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:19.590
If a new job from DMs isn't here yet, click "Sync".

4
00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:28.180
For a phone job, click "New job"; "Send details to the customer" sends the time and technician to the customer.

5
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:35.410
An "Overlap" mark means two jobs at once for one person; fix it before telling the customer.
